WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.950
A Ferris wheel: radius fifteen metres,
centre sixteen metres above the ground.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.520
It turns once every four minutes.

3
00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:11.100
You board at the bottom, one metre up.

4
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.370
Your height traces out a graph.

5
00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.930
A dashed line marks twenty metres.

6
00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.120
The ride lasts ten minutes.

7
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:21.930
How many times is your seat
exactly twenty metres up?

8
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.970
In this mission, you'll
model the height as a wave:

9
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:29.720
h equals sixteen minus
fifteen cos of pi t over two.

10
00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:34.020
You'll read off its amplitude,
its period and its principal axis.

11
00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:38.220
And you'll learn that solving a trig
equation means finding every intersection

12
00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:39.470
in the interval.

13
00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:44.510
Your mission: work out how often your seat
is at twenty metres in those ten minutes.
